aqua:HydrochemicalSignal a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:ChemicalSignal .
aqua:HydrochemicalProperty a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Characteristic .
aqua:MicrobialCommunity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Entity .
