aqua:IronCycler a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:FunctionalGuild .
aqua:Methanogen a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Archaea .
aqua:Methanotroph a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Bacterium .
aqua:Phototroph a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:FunctionalGuild .
aqua:Chemolithoautotroph a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Autotroph .
aqua:GeologicalSetting a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:EnvironmentalSetting .
aqua:PedologicalSetting a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:EnvironmentalSetting .
